---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Qingniao's privacy policy — what this site collects and what it does not">
  <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.75rem;">Privacy</h1>

  <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">In one sentence: this site collects no personal information.</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0;">Qingniao's site is a static site — no accounts, no forms, no comments (for now). When you visit, I never see your name, email, or anything that identifies you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Analytics I run</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">
        <li>The site uses <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to measure visits. It collects anonymous, aggregated visit data (page views, referrers, approximate geography).</li>
        <li>It uses <b>no cookies</b>, does not track you across sites, and does not tie data to your identity.</li>
        <li>I only look at aggregate numbers (e.g. "how many visitors on a given day") to see whether content gets read — not at individual visitors.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Hosting</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0;">The site is hosted on <strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong>. Cloudflare handles connection logs to industry standards; this site sets and uses no cookies or local storage to track visitors.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="card">
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Questions or want more detail? Reach me at <a href="mailto:hi@qingniao.dev">hi@qingniao.dev</a>. This policy is maintained by Qingniao directly and is meant in good faith — this site genuinely does not collect your personal information.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>